	abstract = {Welcome to the first chapter of The Things Fundamentals on {LoRaWAN}. In this section, you’ll learn why {LoRaWAN} is so awesome, hear about some great {LoRaWAN} use cases, and learn the difference between {LoRa} and {LoRaWAN}.
